
                                                  CONFIG MERGE CLEAN CHECKSUM COMMAND


Config merge clean checksum command implements the merge clean checksum functionality

-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SWITCHES                             |    DESCRIPTION
-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   -in_t                             |    Template input XML file.
   -in                               |    Input XML file.
   -cleanin                          |    Input XML file for clean.
   -rule_t                           |    Template rules XML file.
   -rule                             |    Input rules XML file.
   -out_t                            |    Template output XML file.
   -out                              |    Output XML file.
   -all_hex                          |    lst file which contains all the input hex files.
   -checksum_clean_out               |    Output clean XML file for Checksum clean.
   -clean_t                          |    Template input XML file for clean.
   -clean                            |    Input XML file for clean.
   -info_t                           |    Template XML file for Infoblock.
   -info                             |    Input XML file for infoblock merge.
   -info_clean_checksum              |    Input XML file for clean checksum.
   -prj_hex                          |    Source input HEX file.
   -clean_otp_hex                    |    Input HEX file for clean OTP.
   -swsh_hex                         |    Input HEX file for SWSH.
   -all_hex                          |    lst file which contains all the input hex files.
   -hex                              |    Input HEX file.
   -clean_checksum_hex               |    Clean checksum input HEX file.
   -hexmod_log                       |    Merged Logfile for hexmod.
   -hexmod18                         |    To identify it is MDG1 project.
   -abm_out                          |    Output XML file for ABM.
   -abm_t                            |    Template input ABM file.
   -trimmed_hex_file_infoblocks      |    Trimmmed input hex file for infoblock.
   -trimmed_hex_file_infoblocks_out  |    Specifies the name of the command. Optional.
   -trimmed_hex_file_infoblocks_hex  |    Specifies the name of the command. Optional. 
--------------------------+----------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Example:

--rule_t      _gen/swb/module/hexmod/RULES.XT
--in_t        _gen/swb/module/hexmod/INPUT.XT
--info_t      _gen/swb/module/hexmod/INFOBLOCK.XT
--info_check_t  _gen/swb/module/hexmod/INFOBLOCK_CHECK.XT
--out_t       _gen/swb/module/hexmod/OUTPUT.XT
--abm_t       _gen/swb/module/hexmod/ABM.XT
--clean_t             _gen/swb/module/hexmod/CLEANUP.XT
--core_exp    _gen/swb/module/coreproc/filelist_gen_merged_exp.txt
--prj_adx      _gen/swb/module/asap2/MG1CS001_P1112_V181_PROTOTYPE.adx
--all_hex     _gen/swb/module/hexmod/all_hex_files.lst
--prj_hex     _gen/swb/module/hexmod/MG1CS001_P1112_V181_PROTOTYPE_src.hex
--hex         _gen/swb/module/hexmod/MG1CS001_P1112_V181_PROTOTYPE_tmp.hex
--clean_otp_hex         _gen/swb/module/hexmod/MMD104VMAC1483_N6A0_CORETASK0_cleaned_otp.hex
--clean_checksum_hex        _gen/swb/module/hexmod/MG1CS001_P1112_V181_PROTOTYPE_clean.hex
--hexmod18    
--lyt          0x20
--rule        _gen/swb/module/hexmod/rule_merge.xml
--in          _gen/swb/module/hexmod/input_merge.xml
--info        _gen/swb/module/hexmod/infoblock_merge.xml
--info_check    _gen/swb/module/hexmod/info_check/infoblock_check_merge.lst
--out         _gen/swb/module/hexmod/output_merge.xml
--abm_out     _gen/swb/module/hexmod/abm_gen.xml
--cleanin             _gen/swb/module/hexmod/clean_input.xml
--clean               _gen/swb/module/hexmod/clean.xml
--info_clean_checksum              _gen/swb/module/hexmod/chksum_info.xml
--checksum_clean_out              _gen/swb/module/hexmod/chksum_clean_output.xml
--hexmod_log   _log/swb/module/hexmod/hexmod_merge.log
--logfile      _log/swb/module/hexmod/config_hexmod_merge.log
